      "value": "This a a bug that is still ongoing, there is a few avatars I have that will force one to become small and have no way to scale them ingame\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/449386885299830794/1160018508256653332/2023-10-06_21-58-00.mp4?ex=6533226c&is=6520ad6c&hm=9dacc28efa1517a14289e429b2b2501739250312abd921763adf5101baa17cee&\n\nSome Avatars that get scaled too small: https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_bca9e468-4d11-4410-8205-7a783296e768\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_21697d21-bc21-4717-8772-7dfe977e5413\n\nSome Avatars that get too big:\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/user/usr_f7146fe7-9d95-4e3e-ae2d-10a4fa782a6b",
